Subject: [PATCH] Add SoftRole-HetNet behind --softrole (additive; HetNet path
 unchanged)

New package softrole/ (graph, weight bank, communication round, network,
policy, trainer, environment helpers, flags, frozen-policy evaluation),
14 unit tests (18 cases) and a SoftRole variant of the gradient-contract
probe. main.py registers the flags and dispatches; hetnet_ext/recording.py
also records sr_* diagnostics. Nothing under hetgat/, trainer.py,
multi_processing.py or envs/ changes.

